WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.744
Help and support are one click away in the portal.

00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:12.304
Give Feedback sends your comments straight to the developers, with your map view if you choose.

00:00:12.964 --> 00:00:15.828
Cancel closes the form.

00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:22.666
About explains the Digital Twin concept, and Account manages your profile.

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:28.879
The Help button opens the tour, videos and step by step guides.

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:36.470
You can restart the guided tour from here at any time, and the guides walk through common tasks.

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:43.702
That is help and support. The team's contact details are in the guide below.
